# Stream captures from StreamProbe.
#
# Scoped to a captures/ directory and the repo root rather than matching *.ogg and friends
# anywhere: ADR-0007 needs a placeholder .ogg committed under resources so the sound registry
# resolves, and a blanket rule would silently refuse to add it.
/captures/
/*.raw
/*.mp3
/*.ogg
/*.aac
